%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "18px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Doctor
    participant PC as PrescriptionsController
    participant PS as PrescriptionsService
    participant PR as PrismaService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over D,DB: FLUJO CREAR PRESCRIPCION

    D->>PC: POST /prescriptions {patientId or patientEmail, items, notes}
    PC->>PS: create(dto, doctorId from JWT)
    PS->>PS: Validar patientId o patientEmail

    alt patientId proporcionado
        PS->>PR: user.findFirst where id=patientId AND role=PATIENT
        PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM "User" WHERE id=? AND role=PATIENT
    else patientEmail proporcionado
        PS->>PR: user.findFirst where email=patientEmail AND role=PATIENT
        PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM "User" WHERE email=? AND role=PATIENT
    end

    DB-->>PR: User | null
    PR-->>PS: User

    alt Paciente no encontrado
        PS-->>D: 404 Paciente no encontrado
    end

    PS->>PS: Generar codigo unico PRESC-XXXXXX
    PS->>PR: prescription.create with items as JSON
    PR->>DB: INSERT INTO "Prescription" items=JSON items
    DB-->>PR: Prescription
    PR-->>PS: Prescription
    PS-->>D: Prescription 201

    Note over D,DB: FLUJO VER PRESCRIPCIONES patient

    participant Pt as Patient
    participant PtC as PrescriptionsController
    participant PtS as PrescriptionsService

    Pt->>PtC: GET /prescriptions JWT role=PATIENT
    PtC->>PtS: findAll pagination currentUser
    PtS->>PR: prescription.findMany where patientId=currentUser.id
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM "Prescription" WHERE patientId=? LIMIT ? OFFSET ?
    DB-->>PR: Prescription list
    PR-->>PtS: Prescription list
    PtS-->>PtC: data and meta pagination
    PtC-->>Pt: {data: [...], meta: {...}}

    Note over D,DB: FLUJO CONSUMIR PRESCRIPCION

    Pt->>PtC: PATCH /prescriptions/:id/consume
    PtC->>PtS: consume prescriptionId currentUser.id
    PtS->>PR: prescription.findFirst where id=prescriptionId AND patientId=currentUser.id
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM "Prescription" WHERE id=? AND patientId=?
    DB-->>PR: Prescription | null
    alt IDOR - no es el dueno
        PtS-->>Pt: 403 No tenes acceso a esta prescripcion
    end
    alt Ya consumida
        PtS-->>Pt: 400 Ya esta marcada como consumida
    end
    PtS->>PR: prescription.update status=CONSUMED consumedAt=now
    PR->>DB: UPDATE "Prescription" SET status=CONSUMED consumedAt=now
    PtS-->>Pt: Prescription actualizada 200